# Towerwalk is a landwalk like any other: Illusionary Presence gains it (Bot1 chooses Tower at its turn 5 upkeep), and
# Concerted Effort, whose trigger resolves next, gives each creature Bot1 controls each landwalk one of them has (CR 702.14a,
# 611.2a), so Memnite gains towerwalk too and Bot2, who controls Urza's Tower, can't block it with Ornithopter (CR 702.14c).
# The three upkeep triggers are ordered so the land type is chosen first and the cumulative upkeep {U}{U} is paid last.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Concerted Effort
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island
Illusionary Presence
Memnite
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Urza's Tower
Ornithopter
Island x13

